// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P427266664" "Just me and you, pal!  And I got plenty of ammunition!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3936753285" "This is Family turf!  You're in the wrong place!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1166104913" "You shoot like my grandmother!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2586947681" "It's called 'line of sight', try it!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOOTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4024242453" "You picked the wrong alley."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOOTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1751753128" "A lead magnet.  Excellent!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_SHOOTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3920482066" "Another target!  Nice!"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_ALLEY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2049190772" "We'll finish this later.  Get that one."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_ALLEY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2265742120" "Bad timing."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_ALLEY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P741075753" "Shoulda stuck to the streets."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1300807051" "You gotta learn not to stiff The Family."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1664762075" "You're starting to become a problem."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1274288791" "Did you honestly think you could mess with The Family and get away with it?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2919224250" "Today it's a few broken bones.  You're running out of luck."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3741843255" "Smart move stepping in on Family business.  Take care of it, boys."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2719552140" "Time to enforce a little respect."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3527011972" "Some people just never learn."

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_BREAKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1770651921" "Clear so far."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_BREAKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P61301959" "I see a few stragglers.  Nothing to worry about."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_BREAKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P545313075" "You might wanna hurry it up a bit."

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_BREAKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1809134389" "You got too curious, pal!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_BREAKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2917511524" "Shoulda kept walking!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_BREAKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3994796496" "Big mistake.  Get out here, we got company."

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_BREAKOUT_LEAVEDOOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3856400793" "You messed with the wrong people."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_BREAKOUT_LEAVEDOOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1244925686" "Take em down.  We can't afford witnesses."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_BREAKOUT_LEAVEDOOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3050631058" "Nobody messes up an operation and gets away with it!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2464236790" "Gimme a few more seconds.  I got most of the layout."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3045248177" "One minute.  Sketching the exits.  We gotta get this right."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1580083298" "I survey.  You keep watch.  Stop bothering me."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3719939909" "This building will be easy to crack."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1390115764" "Nuts.  I forgot my eraser."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3855894466" "I love Dockside.  So easy to case."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_SKETCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3277204164" "You need to learn not to step in on Family business."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_SKETCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P83962385" "Take care of this.  I'll mark the exits later."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_SKETCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1611884042" "I only got the exits half-sketched.  Take care of this.  I'll finish up later."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2921062563" "Hurry it up a bit.  I see stragglers."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4090516581" "We're good...for now.  Just work faster."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2434624214" "You're taking too much time.  People are gonna get curious soon."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P420349773" "Quick sketch, Michelangelo.  Just the doors."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4111238709" "I could have bought a camera, taken the photograph, developed the film, and printed the picture by now.  Come ON."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P371514469" "We got company."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1979453917" "Put the pad away.  We got company."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P118621159" "We're made.  Let's clean this up."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CASING_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2626743589" "You picked the wrong place to get nosy, punk."

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2122296055" "Hey, pal, I can do this all...day...long."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3415793480" "Tell me what I want to know and I may go easy on you."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1292452797" "The pain doesn't stop until I start getting some answers."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1020463867" "Start talking or this goes on until every bone is broken."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3775349315" "You'll pass out long before I grow bored, so start talking."

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1507487482" "We'll finish this later.  Clear the street!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3552839349" "We're not done here.  I'll take care of YOU now and him later."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2633543781" "Curiosity will get you killed."

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1483475018" "Look!  I'm telling you!  I don't know anything!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P99095065" "It wasn't me!  I wasn't there.  I keep telling you!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4147031020" "You got the wrong guy!  I don't know anything!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1588981626" "You're not getting anything out of me!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2944937293" "My lips are sealed."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1567856285" "Ungh!  I'm...not...talking..."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3469241161" "I d-don't know anything!  I s-swear!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2906952347" "L-Look, it's all a misunderstanding!  You got the wrong guy!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2782937267" "Don't do this!  I'll talk!  I'll talk!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2684213908" "I had no idea the operation was gonna go down like that!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1212528636" "I'm outta here!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P746470451" "I'll...just....let you take care of them!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P593668460" "Thanks for the interruption, pal!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3049528245" "Great timing!  I'm history!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P772407582" "Tell me...what I want to know.  Or cement feet will be the least of your problems."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3573764334" "Start talking or my trigger finger starts to get real twitchy."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3835750092" "My finger is starting to twitch..."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P667265524" "See this gun?  See the barrel?  It's pointed directly into your face.  Start...talking."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P389840753" "You've been a very naughty boy."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2589036353" "That water looks cold and this gun says you need to start talking or start hopping."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4032051620" "You need to learn to mind your own business, ace."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P72150530" "I won't forget this.  Big BIG mistake."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1343562541" "You'll be easy enough to find!  I'll deal with you later.  Interruptions need to be dealt with."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2337371217" "We're far from settled.  I don't like interruptions and you will pay for your bad timing!"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P894118797" "We're comin' for you.  No one gets away!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2450984965" "You can run, but you can't hide!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3264270039" "We're coming for you!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4064835208" "Just follow the trail of blood.  He's not far."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2883169216" "You got him in the leg, he'll be slowing down."

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P884755758" "He won't get far.  Take out that one instead.  Saw too much."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1183389078" "Interruptions.  Deal with it.  We'll get him later."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1740412082" "He took a hit to the leg.  He won't get far.  Settle the intrusion first."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_CHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2110256607" "Wrong place wrong time, pal."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P164838032" "Best prices in Dockside."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P360452177" "I can cut you a deal if you buy in bulk."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1148375840" "Forget the guy around the corner, I've got better prices."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3117994752" "Look, pal, I haven't got all day.  Are we going to do a deal or what?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3927124590" "Time is money.  The longer you take to decide, the higher the prices goes."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_DEALER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3515220991" "Mind your own business!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_DEALER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P197335565" "Let's take care of the nuisance first."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_DEALER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2680653293" "Freakin' interruptions at my place of business.  Oh, you will pay all right.  With a few slugs to the chest."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P539393873" "Just give me a second to think about this."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3453093924" "The price is right.  Can you get me bulk goods?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3826165823" "Is this all you got?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1483643344" "Not much selection here.  I hope the price is right."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BUYER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1302862016" "Saw too much, take care of it."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BUYER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1539960694" "We'll transact later.  Get the punk."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BUYER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3875134716" "Freaking interruptions.  Let's take care of it."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3126393434" "I have a set limit I can spend."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2850268645" "At least your prices are better than the guy down the street."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P379747208" "Will you be here for a while?  I need to get a second opinion."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P149766954" "I'm not sure..."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P513951449" "I've heard bad things about dealing with The Family.  I'm not sure..."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_BUYER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3982066738" "I knew this was a mistake!  I'm out of here!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_BUYER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3571717615" "I knew this would happen!  I'm gone!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_BUYER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1926765217" "Ack!  I'm out of here!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_BUYER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1875034446" "I knew this was a bad idea!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2353972697" "I-I could uh...lower the price for the F-Family..."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1990112069" "Uh...uh...is this what your b-boss is looking f-for?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3593215414" "Y-Yes, they're the best prices in Dockside.  E-Especially for the Family."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2781971856" "I can get you whatever you need.  The Family gets what it wants."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_DEALER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2830594010" "This deal is not worth dying for!  I'm gone!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_DEALER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3641575388" "Forget it!  No deal is worth this!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NPC_DEALER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1714034920" "I wasn't doing anything!  I'm gone!"

// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1355730849" "Looks clear here.  I'll let you know if I see anything, boss."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2711910134" "I see some wanderers.  They won't get in our way."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P913942083" "If anyone gets close, we'll take care of it.  The Family has this area.  No one will get through."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1730710628" "Oil Spill is clear on this end."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2982835364" "We're clear here."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1486923337" "Nothing to report.  I'll check in later."

// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P498399694" "Gotta go.  We have company.  Taking care of it."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1590005751" "I see someone.  Let's take care of it."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_HUSTLEDAY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P936419294" "Get your fine goods here."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_HUSTLEDAY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3513657208" "Come buy something.  Or else."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_HUSTLEDAY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3988385463" "Best prices in Dockside for ten minutes of your time."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_HUSTLEDAY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P133132074" "Hey, buddy, wanna buy a watch?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_HUSTLEDAY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3754663083" "Fresh off the cargo ship.  The Family has the best prices in Dockside."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_HUSTLEDAY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3328228939" "If you bought your goods elsewhere, you overpaid."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_HUSTLENIGHT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4185378648" "Sucker!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_HUSTLENIGHT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1674535381" "Easy pickings."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_HUSTLENIGHT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1192157539" "Get the wallet, too."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_HUSTLENIGHT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2436073000" "So many suckers in Dockside."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_HUSTLENIGHT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P566737370" "This is almost too easy."

// OAKES_GENERIC_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1042277697" "Down the road and around the corner.  Patrol that area, too."
// OAKES_GENERIC_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3416602463" "The Family must maintain a strong presence here."
// OAKES_GENERIC_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4259680472" "We'll head to the warehouse and patrol around there."
// OAKES_GENERIC_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1355328378" "Keep the presence in Port Oakes strong.  People will learn to respect The Family."

// OAKES_GENERIC_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4221349933" "Get them!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3732893427" "Take care of this.  We'll patrol later."
// OAKES_GENERIC_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1183746811" "Why you gotta be going up against The Family.  You're just going to lose!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P40336777" "We own this place.  Come get some.!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1222334744" "Let's clean the streets!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3312194781" "This is going to hurt you more than it's going to hurt me."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4103734912" "So stupid.  Why you gotta go against The Family?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1376353447" "You think you can cheat The Family and get away with it?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P926523927" "You try and stiff The Family, you get clipped."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3504420860" "You...just...do...not...learn."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3156475992" "It's your fault Joey got pinched.  You...will...pay."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1202190331" "You mess with a Family earner and you pay.  So stupid."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2707246944" "You're a rat.  You will be exterminated."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3044648941" "Bad mistake messing with Family business, meat."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2914758286" "You should have just walked on by."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1504395923" "I swear people around here NEVER learn to mind their own business."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P473017963" "Are you stupid?  Get them!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_BLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P326875917" "See this bat?  It says don't EVER mess with The Family."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_BLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3894663984" "Be glad I'm using the bat and not a gun, rat!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_BLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3570828174" "You...need...to...learn...not...to...stiff...The Family."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_BLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3783496811" "You mess with The Family EVER again and I won't use a bat.  I'll use a gun!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_PAYBACK_BLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1256977353" "Payback in public places.  The only way you guys ever learn!"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2806546241" "Okay.  It's like this.  We got Snakes on the water and Hellions uptown.  First we go after Snakes then we take out Hellions."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P197047861" "We keep it simple.  Saul cased the joint last week and it's clean.  In and out."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3804575436" "You got the plans, Mickey?  Saul sketched them last week."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P216842540" "Fast job.  No witnesses."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2321100378" "Jake says he's a stand-up guy.  If I smell a rat, he goes down.  We meeting at the usual spot?"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3781280884" "Shhh...keep it down.  We got this.  The job happens in an hour."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3417627268" "Down by the club on the docks.  The mark is there.  Show him not to mess with us."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P659127937" "The Lost are messing up our import business.  We need to take them out."

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PLOTMASTERMIND_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2258354676" "We got company!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PLOTMASTERMIND_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P121268246" "We'll finish this later.  Take care of the busybody!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PLOTMASTERMIND_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1181651191" "You shoulda just walked on by, meat."
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_PLOTMASTERMIND_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2183049902" "Serves you right for interrupting me when I'm plotting!"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_RUNNINGROBBERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3549929548" "Go go go!  Alarms went off!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_RUNNINGROBBERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1090371928" "Freaking alarms!  Saul messed up the sketch!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_RUNNINGROBBERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1406993167" "You said this place was clean!  Run!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_RUNNINGROBBERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3619240760" "Go go go!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_RUNNINGROBBERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P908934619" "Bad intel!  Make a run for it!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_RUNNINGROBBERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3484383888" "Saul's gonna hear about this!  His intel sucks!"

// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_RUNNINGROBBERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3859596065" "Oh you're not getting this stuff!"
// OAKES_MARCONEVILLE_RUNNINGROBBERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3404853906" "This stuff is ours.  You shoulda just walked on by!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1981448528" "Let this bat be a warning.  Don't EVER mess with The Family!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3728839473" "My bat.  Your skull.  Lesson learned."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2953805705" "You...shouldn't...have...messed...with...us."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3582162287" "It's gonna be a homerun, meat!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P29260551" "I'll deal with you later!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3861304291" "Shoulda kept on walking, meat!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P438673119" "No witnesses!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2234799913" "Nice outfit.  Too bad I gotta shred it."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1393082448" "Hope you don't mind blood on that outfit.  This knife says you got some learning to do."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3750900922" "I'm going to gut you like a fish!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P781483534" "You and me, we got some business to do.  You saw too much."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3730773676" "Dockside belongs to us.  I don't mind beating that into you."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P701440964" "I'm going to mess you up!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1826413449" "Stupid punk, getting into Family business!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1770795999" "Deal with this!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1828794093" "Let's do this!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_GREEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3167347008" "You got some nerve trying to break off from the Family."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_GREEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1171580177" "Mooks got no place here.  You should stick to the sewers where you belong."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_GREEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P260153480" "This is what happens when you bite the hand that feeds you, Mooks."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_GREEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1659314935" "Let's take it to the mattresses, Mooks!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_GREEN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2227837312" "Clean this up!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_GREEN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P580185877" "Take care of the meat!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_GREEN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3700072200" "Freaking newbs trying to move in on our territory, too, now!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_PURPLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1204070312" "What?  You can't stay in your own territory?  You gotta try and get ours, too?"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_PURPLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2934734793" "Big mistake coming to Mook territory."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_PURPLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4146868554" "You want another beating?  Just keep pushing us and you'll get it."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_PURPLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3534694767" "I guess you didn't get the memo.  This is Mook territory."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_PURPLE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2794997458" "Let's take it to the mattresses!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_PURPLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4239355207" "Nevermind the feud, take care of the meat!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_PURPLE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P228118860" "Family sticks together to take out the meat.  Let's do this!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3985938872" "You got some nerve hanging around, Mooks."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2782620519" "Mooks got no place here.  You should stick to your territory."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4055853771" "You got no loyalty, Mooks!  No loyalty!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P827118127" "Freaking newbs trying to move in on our territory."

// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1102299993" "You had to come looking for trouble.  Well, you found it."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1619968092" "Maybe a few more knocks to the head will beat some sense of direction into you."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2913970892" "You're...in...the...wrong...place."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P76882673" "NOW who's in the wrong place, huh?"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2008489329" "It's you again.  Not this time, meat."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1596934042" "Your lucky day, Mooks.  I got business with this one."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3506271714" "You and I, we got unfinished business!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1458055643" "I'm going to make you bleed, Mook!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P483646821" "You need to learn a little geography, Mook.  Let me mark where you are."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2175730457" "I'm going to fillet you, Mook!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4180815391" "Who are you?  You got no business here!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4259512850" "Can't you see this is a private matter?  Too late!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2871665907" "Take 'em down.  Family makes a strong show.  Always."

// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4150409824" "My fist.  Your jaw.  Lesson learned."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4022775671" "Did I mention I box semi-pro?"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1668729211" "They're gonna need to pick up your jaw with tweezers!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P721396831" "This part of Montrose is ours, Mooks!  You know that!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P904720589" "We settle this later, Mooks.  Take them out."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_GREENFIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P422830968" "Oh you shoulda stayed in Dockside, meat."

// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3903989659" "You want another beating?  I can accommodate."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P373255949" "Let's take it to the mattresses, old guard!"


// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P358073634" "Last week you thought you could teach me a lesson.  This bat says it didn't take."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2018395660" "Now who's in the wrong turf, huh?"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3605943073" "My compare's in the hospital because of you.  Let me return the favor, pal!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P577031890" "I'll take care of you later!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P440983094" "You got lost, meat!"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1566709170" "Joey, get a place ready!  Meat here is going down!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P593657680" "This is for taking out my brother!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3044738669" "You're gonna bleed."

// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3000750915" "I'll take care of you later."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2658905922" "What are you doing here?  Bad move, meat."

// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P746093799" "Your jaw.  My fist.  Favor returned."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P650969822" "We're not even close to being even."
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3909723294" "Now who's in the wrong turf, Family?"

// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3066086827" "Oh, I'm going to enjoy this!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P116400300" "I got something special just for you, meat!"
// OAKES_MONTROSE_BARBRAWLOUT_PURPLEFIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P532180953" "We'll settle this later!  Let's do the newb."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NIGHTDECOY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4187312267" "Yeah.  My car broke down.  I don't know, can you send some guys over?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NIGHTDECOY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1420519619" "Uh huh.  Yeah, I'm here waiting on you, but you ain't here.  You coming or what?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NIGHTDECOY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2343639953" "Yeah.  Sure.  I can look into it.  Pretty late, though."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NIGHTDECOY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P110995168" "It's late, man.  When are you coming?  I don't want to stand here by myself forever."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NIGHTDECOY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3427135937" "Is this meeting going on or what?  It's late."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NIGHTDECOY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1593528793" "Such a sucker."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NIGHTDECOY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3135911416" "Like I'd not have backup!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NIGHTDECOY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1878568200" "You thought you were gonna take me out?  You thought wrong."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_NIGHTDECOY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3074805550" "Let me introduce you to my good friends!"


// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4223114464" "Gonna be a long day."
// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1967705889" "Sometimes muscle is the only thing people listen to."
// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3775889156" "The Family has nothing to worry about.  We got this."
// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P116891969" "Oakes is ours.  All of it.  I'm not worried at all."

// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1970954246" "You tryin' to start something?"
// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P761617315" "What's up with you?"
// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3769471854" "Problems?"
// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2754535470" "I don't like the look of you.  Take 'em out!"

// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3914456116" "Yes!  Another victory!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1277389406" "I'm so much better at this than cards!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4032034569" "This beats the casino any day of the week!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3137428430" "And I win again!"

// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2111690154" "Get your own action!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1168778348" "You want some action?  I'll give you action."
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P515102331" "Seriously, pal.  You need to play something new.  I'm killing you here."
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P386811097" "Can I win one more time?  YES!  Yes I can!"

// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P873715883" "You know I hate you, right?"
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3298710152" "Those dice HAVE to be loaded.  HAVE to."
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2086658290" "This is insane.  I hate this game."
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4080753202" "Have you ever HEARD the word 'gracious'?"
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4108430154" "This game sucks."
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2817445718" "If I keep losing I'm gonna head to the casino and play slots."

// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1566246147" "Oh good!  Someone to take my frustrations out on!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2602945758" "Thanks for the diversion, meat!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3210613083" "You just ruined my friend's winning streak.  You'll have to pay!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3658648886" "You got a problem?"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1784573676" "Dockside is ours!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3981001983" "That all you got?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P165482813" "I can shoot better than you with my eyes closed!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P334861684" "Let me fit you with a lead suit!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P542037915" "More target practice!  Bring it on!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P903710005" "Got some nerve, meat, stickin' your nose where it don't belong!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P416867364" "I'll catch you later, I got some meat to tenderize!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2448820550" "What a dumb move, punk!"

// OAKES_OILSPILL_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3728891756" "Oil Spill is gonna be ours!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P411860151" "You're gonna pay!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3229673563" "I can do this all day!"


// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1477272607" "You in or what?"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1442162995" "I don't have time to haggle.  Hurry up and make a decision."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4135230774" "You want in on this deal or what?"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3026321205" "Hurry up, man, I don't have all day!"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4283982761" "I think I just fell asleep standing up.  You need to make a decision or I'm cutting you loose."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4114946887" "Hey. I got places to be and people to see.  You're either in or you're out.  Now which is it?"

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2664993064" "I don't think you were invited to this business transaction."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2382022356" "This piece of meat better not be with you.  You a cop?  I smell a rat!"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1933627444" "The deal's off!  I smell a rat!"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1583707164" "You're gonna be swimmin' with the fishes if this is a setup, pal!"

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3191002297" "I might be interested in what you have.  Impress me."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2760092544" "I'm thinkin' here."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3027616925" "Shut up already, I'm thinking!"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2436674202" "Slow down, cowboy.  It's not like you're the only show in town, you know."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2855077943" "Hang on...I'm deliberating."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3105428945" "I'm just not entirely sure that what you're selling is worth the price you're asking."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1979030687" "I'm not sure about this..."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BUYER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2875815504" "You've got some nerve interrupting me in the middle of a deal!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BUYER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2506976501" "You again!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BUYER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2695350400" "I'm getting tired of all these interruptions!  How about a lead shower?"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NPC_BUYER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1455954749" "Okay, getting shot at is a deal breaker!  I'm out of here!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NPC_BUYER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P602603983" "This was not what I signed up for!  Deal's off!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NPC_BUYER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P94777136" "You said a quick meeting to discuss terms!  At no time did you mention a spray of bullets!  I'm gone!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NPC_DEALER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P611207821" "I knew this would go wrong!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NPC_DEALER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2903336507" "You set this up!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NPC_DEALER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3554406224" "You set me up!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NPC_DEALER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3400012583" "I should have known better than to deal with you thugs!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NPC_DEALER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P4080407908" "Deal's off!  I didn't sign up for getting shot at!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NPC_DEALER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1268032690" "I smell a rat!  I'm outta here!  Find some other sucker!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1463413077" "See, this is how the Family deals with punks like you."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3673290474" "We're a reasonable bunch of guys.  But you mess with us...we're gonna have to hurt you."

// SHARKHEAD_PRELUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2722144869" "You've made a big mistake, buddy.  We got a real issue with 'witnesses'."
// SHARKHEAD_PRELUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2781292875" "Now you're gonna pay!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRELUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P121687693" "See...the Family...we like to make a statement.  Now unfortunately for you...it's with your blood. BUT...sometimes you need to crack a few eggs..."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3273285900" "Don't let my knife get in your way."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3540478912" "Hope you don't mind a little blood on that snappy outfit!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3402912596" "I think I'm gonna have to hurt you now."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3954132657" "Let's give this boy a physical."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BREAKTIME_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2147442816" "See this black stain?  One of those miners bumped into me and ruined my suit.  Now see this red one?  I made an example of him."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BREAKTIME_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2599191811" "What time you got?  I thought that contact was supposed to be here by now."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BREAKTIME_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P430378401" "Have you seen this article about the Zig?"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BREAKTIME_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1855486158" "Hear about Saul?  I heard he got promoted.  And not in a good way."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BREAKTIME_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3923699688" "Break's over.  Time to crack some skulls!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BREAKTIME_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1189223988" "Time to make an example outta this loser!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BREAKTIME_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P420110009" "That one just looked at me funny.  We need to deal with it."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2837119323" "This looks like it'll be a good target."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P860466460" "I hope you boys have been workin' out, this is gonna be a big haul."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2400405557" "Call the warehouse, tell them to get ready!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P69842204" "Easy...I'm on it.  Just a few more seconds."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P937498675" "I can barely see anything.  How am I supposed to get a decent look?"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P170157329" "Cut me some slack.  You can't even draw stick figures so be patient and shut up."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2824612829" "I have a sketch for you.  It involves a tombstone and a cemetery plot."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3159094488" "There's hundreds of buildings in Sharkhead and you gotta pick this one.  Nice."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_SKETCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P475268466" "Sigh.  Just waste 'em."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3627705528" "If you could sketch a bit faster, that'd be super.  There's private security all OVER this place."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3357214339" "I've fallen asleep standing up.  Hurry UP over there."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1453082670" "So...you just let me know if the change in seasons gives you ANY ideas about scribbling any faster."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P488706812" "Send over back-up."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CASING_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P859291125" "Take a deep breath, it'll be your last!"

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_NPC_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2054119425" "I don't know..."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_NPC_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3510195495" "I'll need to talk to my guys before I commit to this."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_NPC_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1332888135" "This just doesn't sound like the best deal."

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_NPC_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4015607145" "I don't have time to haggle, hurry up and make a decision."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_NPC_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1759642561" "Hurry up man, I don't have all day!"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_NPC_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P700279326" "Time is of the essence."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P109950456" "Things seem quiet. We should hit our deadline."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3504584371" "This shipment hasn't yet been through Quality Control."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1191608800" "We've got everything ready, send down check list."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P610758602" "Send in the guards, we got company!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P254042830" "Is that patrol on route? We got company!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CATWALK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1959375570" "From this vantage point, things seem clear."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CATWALK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P301255572" "All's quiet, but stay on your toes down there."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CATWALK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2502927225" "Reporting for guard duty, out."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CATWALK_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2935703667" "We've got incoming!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CATWALK_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P297138413" "Incoming!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CATWALK_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2088986450" "It's time, get 'em!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P421026807" "Keep these things moving, we have a deadline to meet!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3815249967" "Tell your guys to keep a move on it, lotta work, not much time."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3355762978" "Things are lookin' good from here, we should be on schedule."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2625679933" "You stay with the supplies, I'll take care of this one!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1924800206" "This area is off limits!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1669255382" "Have you ever heard of 'Private Property?!"

// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3004142379" "Can we stop and get coffee?"
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3112389777" "You got the time, I have plans at the bar tonight."
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P22342810" "One more round and it's time for 'Changing of the Guard'."
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2126896631" "Hold on. I gotta see a man about a horse."

// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2368015463" "Let's take care of these goons!"
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3413211214" "Time is of the essence and you've got none left, punk!"
// SHARKHEAD_GENERIC_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1103486057" "I ain't got all day, but I can tell you this one is your last!"

// SHARKHEAD_FAMILY_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1724757306" "All of Sharkhead will someday be completely under our control."
// SHARKHEAD_FAMILY_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2081963538" "I've got that whole place under surveillance."
// SHARKHEAD_FAMILY_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1407896923" "Bugged?  Heh, of course!"

// SHARKHEAD_FAMILY_PLOTMASTERMIND_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P11757095" "I've been interrupted for the last time!"
// SHARKHEAD_FAMILY_PLOTMASTERMIND_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3665696102" "You've messed with the Family for the last time bucko!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P644727666" "Get to work boys, this ship needs to sail!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1282212005" "We need to get another work crew."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3799940041" "Keep it comin', we're making good time now!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3874858321" "Get out of here!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3128123418" "What are you doing here?!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SORDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2120690594" "Get 'em boys!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1730347718" "Things look clear here, how about you?"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P719797669" "The coast is still clear boys."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2146802922" "Is the transmitter in place?"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P690576693" "Send in the reinforcements, we got a live one!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3229297259" "We've got a live one here, boys!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_CEMENTSHOES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P197598793" "L-Look, whatever it is that I did.  I won't do it again.  EVER."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_CEMENTSHOES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4042859403" "Just tell me what you want!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_CEMENTSHOES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3093269712" "I didn't speak to anyone!  I didn't do what you think I did!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_CEMENTSHOES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4136378102" "I'm telling you, I did NOT cross the Family!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_CEMENTSHOES_ALERT_TEXT :
"P87311627" "Ohmygosh ohmygosh omygosh omygosh!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_CEMENTSHOES_ALERT_TEXT :
"P553419989" "S-So out of h-here!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_CEMENTSHOES_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2010216784" "Got...to get out of here...!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P949654779" "This gun is pointed at your head.  Now's not a good time to lie."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4072723886" "I'm having a bad day.  I may just shoot you anyway."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4094192269" "Give me one good reason I shouldn't blow you away right now."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P15435587" "He's not going far.  Bigger fish to fry here!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2521701207" "We'll deal with you later!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4035260713" "Let him hop.  He won't get far.  Let's do this!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P761123755" "I just can't stop laughing."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2359663273" "Look, we gonna do this or what?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2703423880" "I don't have all day.  Crimson is big territory."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1785808165" "Hey, make a decision.  You want in on the deal or not?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1811387108" "This deal expires in 20 seconds.  20...19..."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3584604342" "Look, I got other appointments.  I don't have time to haggle.  You in or out?"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3761827687" "Deal's off!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2307654407" "Hey, let's make a deal.  Prize?  Your life."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3317459127" "Some nerve you got walking in on us."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ__BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3993154736" "You know, there are plenty of you guys on the street.  You're not the only show in town."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ__BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2818508399" "This is a big deal.  I could lose a lot of money on this.  Don't rush me."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ__BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P412784057" "Don't push it.  You stand to lose as much as I do."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ__BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P428457451" "Shut up and let me think."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_BUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2247055121" "Some nerve you got interrupting me in the middle of a deal!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_BUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P853115417" "You again?  I heard about you!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_BUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P423817298" "Oh, mistake.  A big one."


// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_NPC_BUYER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3465617055" "I shouldn't have  listened to you!  You set this up!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_NPC_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4294239269" "I would never stiff the Family.  The deal is legit."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_NPC_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3131802188" "I'm very serious about this deal."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_NPC_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P51406718" "We need to set this up."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_NPC_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3514211444" "I'm open to negotiation, but only if the price is right."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_NPC_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3903353427" "I think we'd make great partners.  The Family is a solid name in Crimson."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_NPC_DEALER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P862182220" "Did you tip them off?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_NPC_DEALER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2161173327" "What is this?  Who did you tell about this deal?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_NPC_DEALER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1677786565" "What's going on here?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CRUZ_NPC_DEALER_FLEE_TEXT :
"P56174597" "What the...?  I'm gone!"

// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1282404466" "Hear about what's going on in Port Oakes with the Mooks?"
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P897001155" "You wanna go get a pop?"
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P565243726" "Let's go to the casino and play some cards."
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2827179721" "No I'm not gonna play dice with you.  I always lose."
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P959610704" "We got a shipment coming in later tonight.  You up for some fun?"
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2511876041" "You wanna go get some pizza?"
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3314711295" "I'm tellin' ya, you don't want to get on Little Ronnie's bad side.  He'll hurt you."
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2988280188" "I'm tellin' ya, you don't want to get on Crazy Lou's bad side.  He'll get you."
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2510041293" "We need to really make our mark here."

// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3992028605" "Two seconds to relax.  Is it that much to ask??"

// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1288029014" "I LOVE this game!"
// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P566607787" "Wow, how much do you owe me NOW?"
// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2667871637" "I can't lose!"
// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3964050419" "Annnnnnnd YES!  Kiss that sweet car of yours goodbye!"
// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3590993444" "He shoots...he SCORES!"
// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2625680040" "I AM the champion, my friend!"

// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1105187541" "You just broke my winning streak!  Oh you will PAY!"
// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2816412385" "Big mistake interrupting my winning streak.  BIG!"
// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2017622558" "Who the heck are you?"
// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3842320898" "Wrong turn, pal!"

// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4089736337" "All I can say is sleep with one eye open."
// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3724776340" "Whatever."
// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2461302477" "I hate playing with you.  You're a sore winner."
// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2437675653" "WHAT!  That's impossible!  How can you win so many times!?"

// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P761993461" "Excellent.  An outlet for my aggression!"
// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3912413811" "Oh, you're going down!"
// NERVA_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2288065093" "You got no business being here!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALL_HOODS_PAYBACK_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4237790617" "You're not listening..."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALL_HOODS_PAYBACK_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3620285423" "No matter how much I shake you.  You still ain't got no sense, pal."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALL_HOODS_PAYBACK_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2155013717" "Are you for real?  What were you thinking?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALL_HOODS_PAYBACK_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2140973324" "Just give us the money you owe us and we may let you live."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALL_HOODS_PAYBACK_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3359824246" "I'm gonna rattle you until everything you stole magically appears in my hand."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALL_HOODS_PAYBACK_SHAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P236100269" "I'm not at all tired.  I'll shake you till I get some answers."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALL_HOODS_PAYBACK_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2063031217" "Let the fun begin!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALL_HOODS_PAYBACK_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2110363357" "More to the party?  I'm okay with that!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALL_HOODS_PAYBACK_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P556934955" "Let's show 'em how The Family takes to being interrupted."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALL_HOODS_PAYBACK_BLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2500372883" "That...is...for...messing...with...Family...business."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALL_HOODS_PAYBACK_BLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1225836505" "If you survive this beating, you tell your boss that if I see your face in Crimson, I take down the lot of you."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALL_HOODS_PAYBACK_BLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P210400490" "This is my favorite part.  The body makeover."

// OAKES_VILLA_CASING_SKETCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P182388120" "Man, Montrose ain't gonna know what hit 'em when we're done.  Few more quick sketches and I'm done."

// OAKES_VILLA_CASING_SKETCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1561362919" "Between you, meat, and those Montrose snoops, I'm never gonna catch a break!"

// OAKES_VILLA_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3524742538" "Look, this isn't So You Wanna Be An Artist.  Just a SKETCH.  Okay?  Sketch?  Soon?  Please?"

// OAKES_VILLA_CASING_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2337123797" "I TOLD you to hurry up!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BREAKTIME_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2779401905" "Heh heh heh.  Guido's in the paper again."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BREAKTIME_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2370183175" "Ah nuts.  Saul got sent up again."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BREAKTIME_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P990516632" "Looks like Eddie got released.  That'll make things interesting."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BREAKTIME_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2952604454" "I'm going to squish you like a bug."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BREAKTIME_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4086187289" "Let me just roll this thing up and swat you with it."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BREAKTIME_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4164896042" "Want a knuckle sandwich?  On the house!"

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHARACNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3932511496" "Look, I got no issue workin' with Arachnos if Arachnos ain't got no problem workin' with me.  Capiche?"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHARACNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P892659653" "Don't be giving me any attitude.  We're on equal footing here, pal.  This deal goes sour, we both lose."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHARACNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3389498373" "I don't care who your boss is.  And for the record?  He ain't here.  So let it go.  I ain't impressed."

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHARACHNOS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3020898901" "You're dead meat, meat!"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHARACHNOS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1411785756" "We BOTH take 'em down!  This gets out we both lose face!"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHARACHNOS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4147836233" "No witnesses!  It'll hurt both of us!"

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1389214836" "I'm not exactly overjoyed doing deals with The Family either, you know."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P39423114" "I don't think I have to remind you who I work for.  So it would be in your best interest to keep it clean."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4081767026" "Dealing with The Family is like sucking rocks through a straw:  painful, tedious, and utterly pointless."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BUYER_ARACHNOS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3988821395" "You planned this!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BUYER_ARACHNOS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3201935875" "I knew you'd find a way to mess this deal up!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BUYER_ARACHNOS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1423914043" "I knew I couldn't trust you!"

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHCONSORTIUM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P763254415" "Dealing with you guys makes my teeth itch."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHCONSORTIUM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2412404121" "There is just something fundamentally wrong about doing a deal with a guy in a badge."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHCONSORTIUM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3017701453" "Look, let's make this quick.  Dealing with cops, even rent-a-cops, makes my acid reflux act up."

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHCONSOTRIUM_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P681205209" "You're undercover??  Both of you are dead!"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHCONSOTRIUM_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1205770771" "What the--  You're DEAD!"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHCONSOTRIUM_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4030341913" "This better not be a setup!  Not witnesses!"

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_CONSORTIUM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1550553213" "Believe me...this doesn't sit too well with me either, pal."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_CONSORTIUM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3941767067" "Whatever.  Deal with it.  You in or not?"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_CONSORTIUM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3183102387" "This wasn't exactly how I envisioned my autumn years on the force either, so shut up and let's do this."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BUYER_CONSORTIUM_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1917316190" "What are you trying to do?  Get me fired??"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BUYER_CONSORTIUM_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P119646444" "What the...  You set me up??"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BUYER_CONSORTIUM_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3760639720" "No witnesses!  Neither of us can afford a snitch!"

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHCOUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1981823742" "I like dealing with Council about as much as I liked dealing with 5th Column.  Which I didn't."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHCOUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3557264988" "I don't like you guys much.  Hate the outfits.  Let's make this quick.  I'm losing style points standing next to you."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHCOUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3915461252" "Make this deal quick.  I got places to be."

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHCOUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3868199718" "What's the big idea!"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHCOUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3737802774" "Great.  The fashion police arrived.  Your fault!"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHCOUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2124983118" "I'm not going down for you!!"

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3074597692" "Just...don't talk."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1807091248" "All you gotta do is trade.  The less lip-flapping, the better."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4034435013" "I can't believe I'm standing here dealing with you.  Make it quick."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BUYER_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3316777815" "I'll remember this!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BUYER_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3473980041" "I knew this was a mistake!  You can't trust The Family!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BUYER_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2002140336" "Who are you!?  You plan this?!"

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHSKYRAIDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3972431661" "See this?  This is me shaking my head having to deal with you Sky Raiders."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHSKYRAIDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2122800890" "Man, did you have to wear the ridiculous hat?  Has the word 'inconspicuous' EVER entered your vocabulary?"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHSKYRAIDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2245239566" "Alright, let's just get this over with, Sky Trader."

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHSKYRAIDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3577195744" "Figures!  Why am I not surprised we'd be interrupted!"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHSKYRAIDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1892686706" "You probably planned this!"
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_DEALER_WITHSKYRAIDERS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2692405828" "Get 'em, Raider!  We can't afford witnesses!"

// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_SKYRAIDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1459880514" "I'm all a-tingle dealing you, too."
// SHARKHEAD_DEALING_BUYER_SKYRAIDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2292859456" "You're giving me grief about my outfit?  Your entire cardboard cut-out family looks like you shop at Brooks Brothers.  Whatever.  We have a deal to make."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BUYER_SKYRAIDER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3084340013" "Figures!  Can't trust The Family!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BUYER_SKYRAIDER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P604414799" "Gee!  What a surprise!  Deal with The Family and bad things happen."

// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_ALLEYSHOOTWITHSCRAP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P77875059" "Do you want me to come closer so you can paint a target on me?"
// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_ALLEYSHOOTWITHSCRAP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2566441962" "You are AWFUL at this!  Do you need a map?"
// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_ALLEYSHOOTWITHSCRAP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2590637410" "Should I just walk up to you so you can get a good clear shot?  You are AWFUL at this!"
// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_ALLEYSHOOTWITHSCRAP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3578044594" "Your aim sucks!  You're giving shootouts a bad name!"

// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_ALLEYSHOOTWITHSCRAP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P576211124" "Hope you got better aim than this loser!"
// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_ALLEYSHOOTWITHSCRAP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2412949935" "A break in the monotony!"
// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_ALLEYSHOOTWITHSCRAP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3441888848" "I'm going to shoot you!"
// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_ALLEYSHOOTWITHSCRAP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P111901180" "You probably couldn't shoot and hit the ground."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_DAY_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2069530987" "It's a great day for pain!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_DAY_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3850062597" "I just feel better when my knuckles hit your body."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_DAY_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1692835430" "I got your pain for ya, right here!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_DAY_FIGHTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P441553431" "Look!  More meat for the grinder!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_DAY_FIGHTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1083335439" "Sure, come on.  Join the party!  I'm not even close to being tired!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_DAY_FIGHTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3293902791" "You're kidding me, right?  Whatever!  I can lay you out, too."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_NIGHT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3720856903" "It's a great night for some pain!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_NIGHT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1839716309" "Tonight is my lucky night.  Sucks for you, but it's my lucky night.  I get to beat you up!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_NIGHT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P823592490" "You shoulda stayed indoors.  Didn't your momma tell you not to wander the streets at night?"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_NIGHT_FIGHTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1343613805" "More meat for the grinder!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_BARBRAWLOUT_NIGHT_FIGHTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2931449733" "You shoulda stayed indoors.  Night time's dangerous."

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_BREAKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P785090608" "Oh, is this too complicated for you?  GET OUT NOW!  You hearin' me NOW??"

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_BREAKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2494872909" "You!  You're dead!"

// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_CEMENTSHOES_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4070846297" "Why you gotta be like this?  We worked together once."

// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_CEMENTSHOES_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1746726309" "YOU sleep with the fishes!  I'm outta here!"

// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2220910177" "How's the cement feel?  Heavy?  Wait till I toss you somewhere you can't get out."
// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3231912483" "Time to play Truth or Consequences.  Let's start with Consequences."
// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2849608335" "See...I'm into telecommunications.  You tell me what I want to know.  I'll show you how to make your ears stop ringing."
// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4226721837" "Okay...here's the deal.  You have two choices of destination:  Hotel or morgue.  Up to you.  Start talking."
// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3258072238" "Start talking now.  Hm.  I can't quite hear you.  Which one of these fingers is the volume knob? *crack* Not that one, eh?  How about this one..."

// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2044533083" "I'm gonna shoot you dead."

// SHARKHEAD_CHASINGWOUNDEDSCRAP_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2826046379" "Oh...don't run, Scrapyarder!  You'll only die tired!"

// SHARKHEAD_CHASINGWOUNDEDSCRAP_CHASER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P377059861" "I'll take you down, too!"

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_HUSTLEDAY_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2879928291" "I got what you want.  The Family sells real reasonable."

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_HUSTLEDAY_SELLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P413952045" "What?  Were you born yesterday?  You're such a sucker!"

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_HUSTLENIGHT_CELLPHONE_DECOY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P932501708" "Uh...yeah...Violet.  I'm here all by myself in this big dark area with a lot of money on me.  It looks like I'll be standing here...by myself...for a long time."

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_HUSTLENIGHT_CELLPHONE_DECOY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3460582472" "Such a sucker!"

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_PAYBACK_BEATERUPPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3853157454" "Oh, you stiffed The Family one too many times, pal."


// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_PAYBACK_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1938310715" "I don't know what you're talking about!"

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_PAYBACK_NPCVICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2918504317" "I'm calling my lawyer!"

// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_THEIF_OUTOFDOOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4024325683" "Forget the job!  We gotta get out of here!  I heard alarms!"

// SHARKHEAD_PORTRECLUSE_THEIF_OUTOFDOOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3530451504" "I ain't goin' down and you're in my way!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_CARSHOOTOUT_NPCMOOKSSHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3474921118" "Your aim sucks!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_CARSHOOTOUT_NPCMOOKSSHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2914813885" "Here, let me make this even!  I'll close my eyes!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_CARSHOOTOUT_NPCMOOKSSHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3395903627" "Hey, I got no problem taking you out, too!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1223932868" "I see you! You think you're pretty clever?"
// STM_ALLHOODS_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P93156494" "Hold still!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4022958004" "You gotta reload sometime."
// STM_ALLHOODS_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1293875527" "Seems like we've been at this for hours."

// STM_ALLHOODS_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2338426063" "You were next anyway, buddy."
// STM_ALLHOODS_CARSHOOTOUT_SHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3068418720" "Aww, man."

// STM_ALLHOODS_FAMILYDEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3582610004" "Part of what you pay for is my... uh... discretion."
// STM_ALLHOODS_FAMILYDEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1933644623" "I REALLY do not want to know why you need to buy a hacksaw and 5 gallons of Hydrochloric acid."
// STM_ALLHOODS_FAMILYDEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3282090638" "No deal, punk."
// STM_ALLHOODS_FAMILYDEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1090719007" "You sure you want to be pushing me that hard?"
// STM_ALLHOODS_FAMILYDEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2202456124" "Don't press your luck, big guy."
// STM_ALLHOODS_FAMILYDEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3184057011" "The Family is always willing to make a deal."
// STM_ALLHOODS_FAMILYDEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2380719780" "You fellas sure ain't someone I'd invite over to mamma's house, but business is business."

// STM_ALLHOODS_FAMILYDEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P503606755" "Hide that roll of cash until after this interruption."
// STM_ALLHOODS_FAMILYDEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P630979562" "We'll finish this deal after I take care of the interruption."
// STM_ALLHOODS_FAMILYDEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1602364666" "You didn't see nothin'."
// STM_ALLHOODS_FAMILYDEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2429688443" "Keep on walkin' by."
// STM_ALLHOODS_FAMILYDEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P927382360" "Oh now you've done it!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_TSOOBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P429325258" "You are not honorable in your dealings!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_TSOOBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P41127176" "The Tsoo will long remember how you are trying to cheat us!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_TSOOBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2434172818" "It's now time to close this deal, before anyone crashes our little party."
// STM_ALLHOODS_TSOOBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1477910924" "Seems fair.... which makes me nervous."

// STM_ALLHOODS_TSOOBUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1460195969" "Interloper!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_TSOOBUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3737481364" "This deal is off!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_TSOOBUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1926265731" "What is this... a setup?!?"
// STM_ALLHOODS_TSOOBUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4112302651" "The Tsoo shall not forget this!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_ARACHNOSBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P986198680" "This is not a Sting, I PROMISE."
// STM_ALLHOODS_ARACHNOSBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1868869794" "C'mon, just fork over the goods already."
// STM_ALLHOODS_ARACHNOSBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3420175979" "Lord Recluse recognizes that a black market is essential to a thriving economy. If his 'piece' of the pie is paid, that is."
// STM_ALLHOODS_ARACHNOSBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P506018923" "As long as my commander is kept in the dark, the goods are yours."
// STM_ALLHOODS_ARACHNOSBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1988340649" "How much per Synapse figurine?"

// STM_ALLHOODS_ARACHNOSBUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1023909987" "Oh man!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_ARACHNOSBUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3675607856" "Sarge sent you?"
// STM_ALLHOODS_ARACHNOSBUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3705901281" "You did not see anything here, Citizen."
// STM_ALLHOODS_ARACHNOSBUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P954638276" "Move along, Citizen."
// STM_ALLHOODS_ARACHNOSBUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1201121852" "Better run AWAY before I run you IN."

// STM_ALLHOODS_FREAKSHOWBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3732562923" "Upgrades, gotta get me some upgrades!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_FREAKSHOWBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3111348376" "Those last lot of servos you sold us were complete junk! And not good junk, at that!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_FREAKSHOWBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P800978960" "Well, you miss the limb at first, but you get over it.  Holidays are hard, though."
// STM_ALLHOODS_FREAKSHOWBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2655976943" "Call me 'geek' one more time...  It' FREAK."
// STM_ALLHOODS_FREAKSHOWBUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2165001626" " 'Freakshow' is okay.  I wanted it to be 'Horrorshow' but what ya goin' to do?"

// STM_ALLHOODS_FREAKSHOWBUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1737258079" "This is my scrap... you get lost."
// STM_ALLHOODS_FREAKSHOWBUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1380115939" "Ain't no looking back, now."
// STM_ALLHOODS_FREAKSHOWBUYER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2050965709" "Fight, Fight!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3178813743" "This lousy mystic decade. What's wrong with a good knife and bat fight?"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2119905206" "The casinos here in Saint Martial represent a significant portion of our income. So we gotta keep an eye out."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P302777005" "Hate them Freakshow. How you ever going to get a dame lookin' like that?"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2563910253" "So I was watching TV the other day... they had some 'mob boss' from Jersey on there. Wearing a Hawaiian shirt! Shameful!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P41555889" "Where's the honor and the loyalty these days?"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P395387024" "My oldest nephew told me yesterday that he was thinking of joining the Freakshow! My fists still hurt from 'lesson' I gave him."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3106317734" "Whatever the boss says, we do.  In fact, he shouldn't even have to say anything."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1116017188" "Keep up the good work, boys, and you'll earn a button in no time."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P742642104" "I swear there's been this gold helicopter followin' me all day."

// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2416950766" "This is it , boys.  Protect the turf!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P29253143" "What's all this?!? Show 'em some manners, boys!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P944196805" "The Family don't take to you goons traipsin' through without payin' a toll!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P618433555" "Stay out of St. Martial!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1666339666" "Stay alert, boys!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1832782969" "It's good to show the Family face around here... remind the shopkeeps who is in charge."
// STM_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3088051932" "Watch for anyone musclin' in on our territory."
// STM_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4172382791" "Keep an eye out for any of those fellas from last week."
// STM_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2025472725" "Those Carnival gals really creep me out.  It's like they thrive on misery.  Worse than any goodfella I know."

// STM_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1023523146" "Show 'em some manners, boys!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2565662801" "Keep on walkin' on by."
// STM_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1944742009" " 'Keep an eye out for strangers' he says.  Got news for him... They're ALL strangers out here."
// STM_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3418781005" "Ain't doin nothing wrong. Just minding my own business."
// STM_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3306936083" "Boss says to play it cool, I play it cool."
// STM_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P686014142" "You keep out of our 'interests' and we won't find you 'interesting', got it?"

// STM_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2504325585" "Okay... Too close, pal."
// STM_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2727282190" "What makes you think I wasn't payin' attention?"
// STM_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3003450911" "Okay, I've had enough of you eyeballin' me!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1131554541" "This is Family property!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3005295858" "I don't know what you were thinkin' chargin' at me like that."

// STM_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3342247795" "Okay... You got it, Boss."
// STM_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2756499764" "I'll meet you there at 6.  And change out of the purple outfit.  Attracts unneeded attention."
// STM_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3087260971" "Been a long time since I been allowed on a heist. Pull some strings for me, willya?"
// STM_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1570898153" "I gotta go...  this phone is probably tapped. In fact... Uh, Prank Caller, Prank Caller... I don't know you!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3360444301" "We gots trouble, Boss."
// STM_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P652639848" "Bring it on! The Family never backs down!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1209447198" "Our turf! Our turf!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_CELLPHONE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3476896107" "You didn't see nothin'!"

// STM_FLOP_FACEOFF_TAUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P407268123" "Watch them Arachnos boys."
// STM_FLOP_FACEOFF_TAUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3430077487" "This here is our turf. Any of them cross, you know what to do, boys."
// STM_FLOP_FACEOFF_TAUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P455341934" "Stand tight fellas.  No one crosses the line."
// STM_FLOP_FACEOFF_TAUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P811040556" "Arachnos... they muscle in almost worse than them Tsoo boys."

// STM_FLOP_FACEOFF_TAUNT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P833506520" "Okay, it's Go time."
// STM_FLOP_FACEOFF_TAUNT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1903147242" "Take 'em down!"
// STM_FLOP_FACEOFF_TAUNT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3147966546" "It's on!"

// STM_JP_FAMILY_GRAVEDIG_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3540348570" "You see, in this world there are two types of people, my friend - those with loaded guns and those who dig. You dig."
// STM_JP_FAMILY_GRAVEDIG_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1920553036" "Seems like only yesterday we put Tommy the Pirate in a hole like this."
// STM_JP_FAMILY_GRAVEDIG_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P837720486" "Ground is soggy.  Don't worry about digging too deep."
// STM_JP_FAMILY_GRAVEDIG_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3348383944" "I hope this is a new spot. I hate it when we dig into one of our old graves."
// STM_JP_FAMILY_GRAVEDIG_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4265819616" "Hurry up with that shovel. Vinnie looks like he's tired of carrying that fella."
// STM_JP_FAMILY_GRAVEDIG_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3886077818" "Weren't we here yesterday?"

// STM_JP_FAMILY_GRAVEDIG_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3593285442" "Hide the evidence!"

// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2394753429" "Thought you could cross the Family? You thought wrong."
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1613304082" "I'm Judge, Vinnie over there is Jury, and my little friend here... Executioner."
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1007958404" "Gimme three reasons why I should let you live.  You got 20 seconds."
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1955118635" "Now why'd you have to go and try and pull a fast one on the Family?  Now we have this little distasteful scene to play out."
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1379005484" "Step back there Vinnie.  Hate for you to ruin that new suit of yours."
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2130000444" "What we HAD was a failure to communicate.  Now we got a full-blown problem."
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3402144712" "You shoulda steered clear of the Casino floor, my friend."
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2860760290" "What was a mere misunderstanding has now blossomed into a very unfortunate incident... for you."

// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1354433381" "This business is not finished!"
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P527678717" "The Boss don't take too kindly to interlopers!"
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3496721694" "Finish this!"
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2189968618" "We gots trouble!"

// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTTSOO_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3915538898" "Hey... this all just a misunderstanding!"
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTTSOO_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1701194509" "A simple call will fix this, I swear"
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTTSOO_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3129123952" "We will be avenged."
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTTSOO_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3422337466" "You can't hold onto those casinos forever, you know."
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTTSOO_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4234062873" "Oh man.... this is not how I was supposed to go out."
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTTSOO_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1116518989" "The Tsoo will not forget this betrayal!"

// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTTSOO_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4193001302" "The Tsoo need no help from your kind."
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTTSOO_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4005998122" "What, you want in on this too?"
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTTSOO_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3237678735" "This is a closed matter to the likes of you!"
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTTSOO_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4065658204" "This is not your concern, fool."

// STM_FLOP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4247029985" "The Flop is a freakin' warzone. We need to step up all our activities... and that's bad news for the likes of you."
// STM_FLOP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3044327324" "You shoulda steered clear of the Flop, my friend."
// STM_FLOP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1024101681" "We own the Flop, you hear?"

// STM_FLOP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2951558158" "The Flop is ours, now get out of our business!"

// STM_FLOP_CAUGHTTSOO_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3613997733" "You can't hold onto the Flop forever, you know."
// STM_FLOP_CAUGHTTSOO_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P753331534" "Sleep with one eye open, for the Far Cloud will find you..."


// STM_JACKPOT_CEMENTSHOES_NPCMOOKVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2393732317" "Whatever I did, tell the boss I'm sorry."
// STM_JACKPOT_CEMENTSHOES_NPCMOOKVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4249578192" "Please...! I have a wife and family."
// STM_JACKPOT_CEMENTSHOES_NPCMOOKVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3689183044" "How long before it's one of you being tossed into the water? Join me and we can take out the boss."
// STM_JACKPOT_CEMENTSHOES_NPCMOOKVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1608166780" "I was only a week late!  What about the grace period?"

// STM_JACKPOT_CEMENTSHOES_NPCMOOKVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3640306285" "I'm outta here."
// STM_JACKPOT_CEMENTSHOES_NPCMOOKVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1940876812" "Suckers!"
// STM_JACKPOT_CEMENTSHOES_NPCMOOKVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1548751739" "You take care of them and I'll just head on outta here."
// STM_JACKPOT_CEMENTSHOES_NPCMOOKVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4057259748" "Time to hit the ol' dusty trail."

// STM_JACKPOT_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P756943507" "Boss, this don't look deep enough."
// STM_JACKPOT_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3064433532" "Forget ceremony.  Let's just wax 'em and dump 'em somewhere."
// STM_JACKPOT_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2817196681" "Well, say something about 'sleep' and 'fishes' and get it over with. I have plans tonight."
// STM_JACKPOT_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P296961890" "I'm BORED. Just waste him already."

// STM_JACKPOT_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3240924717" "Lookout, boss.  We got interference."

// STM_FLOP_CEMENTSHOES_NPCMOOKVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P0" ""
// STM_FLOP_CEMENTSHOES_NPCMOOKVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1132878233" ", "

// STM_FLOP_CEMENTSHOES_NPCMOOKVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3728336946" "Just a little further..."

// STM_FLOP_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3359888328" "The Flop is a warzone. We need to make our message very clear to our rivals. So, in you go."
// STM_FLOP_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3723274105" "Boss, Not sure this is going to be deep enough. We should wait for high tide."

// STM_FLOP_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3918346684" "Someone else wants to play!"
// STM_FLOP_CEMENTSHOES_SHOTGUN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1946932719" "Boss, we got incoming!"

// STM_JACKPOT_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2787837221" "We have our eye on the traffic around the casinos.  No one gets through, got it?"
// STM_JACKPOT_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3466554418" "Man, the Flop is such a warzone. Everyone wants a piece."
// STM_JACKPOT_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1824272286" "I see trouble heading this way."
// STM_JACKPOT_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3999272246" "Stay in formation, boys. Sometimes lookin' tough is enough."
// STM_JACKPOT_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2376971546" "Show of force, boys. The Jackpot belongs to the Family."

// STM_JACKPOT_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P897202186" "Okay, we got trouble here."
// STM_JACKPOT_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1973035110" "Rumble time!"
// STM_JACKPOT_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4166266086" "Trouble is here now. Gear up, fellas."
// STM_JACKPOT_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2878959085" "No one crosses the Family!. No one!"

// STM_FLOP_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2675149155" "We have our eye on the traffic throughout the Flop.  No one gets through, got it?"
// STM_FLOP_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2120225465" "Show of force, boys. The Flop belongs to the Family."

// STM_FLOP_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3483010743" "No one crosses the Family! No one!"
// STM_FLOP_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3347917048" "Show them OUR Family values!"

// STM_JACKPOT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3374723983" "The Flop...  What a hole. If it wasn't so close to our casinos, I'd say torch the whole place."
// STM_JACKPOT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3477773768" "Family runs Jackpot. We gotta keep it clean for our casino patrons."
// STM_JACKPOT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2219333065" "No, no. Family never plays slots.  That's for the rubes from outta town."
// STM_JACKPOT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3663393069" "Trouble definitely filters down from the Flop."

// STM_JACKPOT_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2118054187" "Trouble's here now. Gear up, fellas."

// STM_FLOP_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P840011303" "We outta torch all these buildings.  That's how ya deal with a rat problem."
// STM_FLOP_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1204232263" "Boss sez we need to take over the Flop. Seems like all them other idiots also got the same idea."
// STM_FLOP_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1704880217" "Oh yeah, the Flop is a wreck. When we take it over, we'll start runnin' it all Family style."

// STM_FLOP_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P534931970" "Oh yeah, some roaches to exterminate!"
// STM_FLOP_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1554130798" "This is our territory, punk!"
// STM_FLOP_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P721808861" "Get 'em, boys!"

